  {
   "steps": [
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "Run seven. Oh-two-forty, local. For the file."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_cba55bb942"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "We have been receiving the echo carrier for two years. Old broadcasts, delayed and smeared. A weather report from nineteen fifty. A dispatcher in a city that hasn't been built yet."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_b96e7f34d5"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "Tonight, for the first time, we transmitted. One word, on one-oh-seven-nine. 'Hello.'"
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_fe4ee35592"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "Eleven seconds later, something said it back."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_591f5fa90b"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "Not an echo. The timing's wrong for an echo. It waited. It chose when."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_b635f4c370"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "Marcus wants the array shut down. I told him he's frightened of the first real conversation in the history of our species."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_572b9b151c"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "EVELYN (TAPE)",
      "He told me it isn't a conversation if only one of you is talking."
     ],
     "vo": "evelyn_7e394498b1"
    }
   ]
  },
