    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "RUIZ (TAPE)",
      "The turbines say my name when they spin down. Not a noise that sounds like my name. My name. In my father's voice."
     ],
     "vo": "ruiz_43af8eb022"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "RUIZ (TAPE)",
      "He used to call me in from the yard on his CB. 'Ana. Ana, dinner.' Every night for twelve years."
     ],
     "vo": "ruiz_54e1ddff17"
    },
    {
     "command": "line",
     "args": [
      "RUIZ (TAPE)",
